The goal of this project is to build an incremental Spark ETL pipeline that processes NYC taxi trip data stored as Parquet files.

The pipeline should:
* Read new files from Data/inbox/
* Process only files that have not been processed before
* Clean and deduplicate the data
* Enrich trips with taxi zone information
* Write a complete and continuously growing output dataset

The job must work correctly when new files are added and must not duplicate data when it is run multiple times
